  triage:title "D9 public-item pin never amended; herdr_api_endpoint, HerdrHostEnv, HerdrEndpoint lack test coverage and diverge from sprint contract" ;
  triage:description "No test in crates/atm-architecture/tests/*.rs references herdr_api_endpoint, HerdrHostEnv, or HerdrEndpoint. The required AY.2 public-item pin amendment is absent, not partial. Separately, sprint doc C1 contract specifies these three items as pub; implementation keeps them pub(crate). Net effect is no new public API surface but diverges from written contract. Needs scrum-master/plan reconciliation; no pin test exists to encode the correct choice. D9 specification violation." ;
